{"caption":"","data":"FSC.map_normalizedAddition {n : ℕ} (G L : FSC.Mat n) (hG : Matrix.PosSemidef G) (hL : Matrix.PosSemidef L) (s : ℝ)\n  (hs : 0 ≤ s) :\n  MeasureTheory.Measure.map (fun p => (FSC.lin (FSC.normalizingDiagonal L s)) (p.1 - √s • p.2))\n      ((ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 G).prod (ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 L)) =\n    ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 (FSC.normalizedAdd G L s)","endPos":{"column":6,"line":4},"fileName":"/tmp/fsc-source-reproduction-20260909T012906Z/checkout/FSCProbes/FeasibleVariationAudit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":4},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"FSC.cdf_normalizedAdd_eq_noiseAverage {n : ℕ} (G L : FSC.Mat n) (hG : Matrix.PosSemidef G) (hL : Matrix.PosSemidef L)\n  (t s : ℝ) (hs : 0 ≤ s) :\n  FSC.cdf (FSC.normalizedAdd G L s) t =\n    ∫ (y : FSC.Coord n),\n      FSC.thresholdCDF G\n        ((WeakSimplex.Coord.ofFun fun x => t) + FSC.normalizationShift L t s +\n          √s • y) ∂ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 L","endPos":{"column":6,"line":5},"fileName":"/tmp/fsc-source-reproduction-20260909T012906Z/checkout/FSCProbes/FeasibleVariationAudit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":5},"severity":"information"}
