{"caption":"","data":"FSC.integral_bilinear_multivariateGaussian {n : ℕ} (L : FSC.Mat n) (hL : Matrix.PosSemidef L)\n  (B : FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] ℝ) :\n  ∫ (y : FSC.Coord n), (B y) y ∂ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 L =\n    ∑ i, ∑ j, L i j * (B ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) i)) ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) j)","endPos":{"column":6,"line":7},"fileName":"/tmp/fsc-source-reproduction-20260909T012906Z/checkout/FSCProbes/FeasibleVariationAudit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":7},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"FSC.Peano2.hasDerivWithinAt_cdf_normalizedAdd {n : ℕ} {G L : FSC.Mat n} {t : ℝ} {l : FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] ℝ}\n  {B : FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] ℝ}\n  (hp : FSC.Peano2 (FSC.thresholdCDF G) (WeakSimplex.Coord.ofFun fun x => t) l B) (hG : Matrix.PosSemidef G)\n  (hL : Matrix.PosSemidef L) :\n  HasDerivWithinAt (fun s => FSC.cdf (FSC.normalizedAdd G L s) t)\n    (l (FSC.normalizationVelocity L t) +\n      1 / 2 * ∫ (y : FSC.Coord n), (B y) y ∂ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 L)\n    (Set.Ici 0) 0","endPos":{"column":6,"line":8},"fileName":"/tmp/fsc-source-reproduction-20260909T012906Z/checkout/FSCProbes/FeasibleVariationAudit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":8},"severity":"information"}
{"caption":"","data":"FSC.Peano2.hasDerivWithinAt_cdf_normalizedAdd_of_hessian {n : ℕ} {G L : FSC.Mat n} {t : ℝ} {l : FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] ℝ}\n  {B : FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] FSC.Coord n →L[ℝ] ℝ}\n  (hp : FSC.Peano2 (FSC.thresholdCDF G) (WeakSimplex.Coord.ofFun fun x => t) l B) (hG : Matrix.PosSemidef G)\n  (hL : Matrix.PosSemidef L)\n  (hB :\n    ∀ (i j : Fin n),\n      (B ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) i)) ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) j) =\n        FSC.stress G t i j - if i = j then t * l ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) i) else 0) :\n  HasDerivWithinAt (fun s => FSC.cdf (FSC.normalizedAdd G L s) t) (1 / 2 * (FSC.stress G t * L).trace) (Set.Ici 0) 0","endPos":{"column":6,"line":9},"fileName":"/tmp/fsc-source-reproduction-20260909T012906Z/checkout/FSCProbes/FeasibleVariationAudit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":9},"severity":"information"}
